    "sections": [
     [
      "",
      "Northgate Observer has obtained the final report on the Tessaly school census, which officials had delayed twice since the spring."
     ],
     [
      "What the report found",
      "The report breaks down litres per second by district. Officials cautioned that figures for two districts are provisional."
     ],
     [
      "Background",
      "Last year's report counted 452 L/s in Dunvale district; the methodology has since changed, so the numbers are not directly comparable."
     ],
     [
      "Reaction",
      "“We expect the numbers to be revised as more inspections are completed,” a spokesperson for the Fallowmere council said."
     ]
